{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e6aebc97bb8f51ba42abb78d02f2b292869faecb1a81bde35ef80d45d332f3f3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3bd07907e1cbfc9aedf239f5efdfb403b6e5ad1b97b4479c04c56d106b8c02fc","logical_entry_identity":"95e47ce56f71bc85932f719a2b988f3482fcaeda0fe51ea6e939507d3355f013","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Magical wands are made by powerful Alchemists and Archmagi to store spells. Anybody can use them to release the spells.","source_tag":"_t","target":"魔杖由强大的炼金术师和大法师制造，用于储存法术。任何人都可以用它释放其中的法术。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3c101b48b02a6fa0f60b91d8c12671d04f802f5d35cd41d63f9a29b7ebcabdfa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ae45ec51d39e48ceac7f7e943c0155f8798b6b6b16d628b659eaccc34bf3d6a1","logical_entry_identity":"ef38c6f671e29544939ddb485dacd2a259d27aec2df2ba44269a11cbb81dbfaa","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You root yourself into the earth, and transform your flesh into stone.  While this spell is sustained, you may not move, and any forced movement will end the effect.\n\t\tYour stone form and your affinity with the earth while the spell is active has the following effects:\n\t\t* Reduces the cooldown of Earthen Missiles, Pulverizing Auger, Earthquake, and Mudslide by %d%%.\n\t\t* Grants %d%% Fire Resistance, %d%% Lightning Resistance, %d%% Acid Resistance, and %d%% Stun Resistance.\n\t\tResistances scale with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你将自己扎根于大地，并将肉体化为石头。\n\t\t在此法术维持期间，你无法移动，任何强制位移都会终止此效果。\n\t\t此法术激活时，你的石化形态和与大地的亲和力会产生以下效果：\n\t\t* 使岩石飞弹、粉碎钻击、地震和山崩地裂的冷却时间缩短 %d%%。\n\t\t* 获得 %d%% 火焰抗性、%d%% 闪电抗性、%d%% 酸性抗性和 %d%% 震慑抵抗。\n\t\t抗性随法术强度提升。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f5d47ac9c425e3447951ee3a77f13725d85031ed8479e8aa86f20909319ba5cf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b4dfb493d9bc222398e81c6208f4b56e48a744516cbe2054a2ed7a7584aaace7","logical_entry_identity":"e468dc9a6c6dcf5abd46589fd12bb48744a7ea324a63094259d4f70dcf2e57e4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Enhances your grapples with additional effects. All additional effects will apply to every grapple with no additional save or resist check.\n\t\t#RED#Talent Level 1:  Reduces physical power by %d\n\t\tTalent Level 3:  Silences\n\t\tTalent Level 5:  Reduces global action speed by %d%%","source_tag":"tformat","target":"增强你的抓取，使其获得额外效果。所有额外效果都会应用于每次抓取，且无需额外的豁免或抵抗鉴定。\n\t\t#RED#技能等级 1：降低目标 %d 点物理强度\n\t\t技能等级 3：沉默\n\t\t技能等级 5：降低目标 %d%% 全局速度"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"610733eeea2627e2fa263c06c4e583603a63c16c6b4c26b6b7d9b78865b20207","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ec949b2c4323498e4e51e129de700a151d2e68db817b8eb5b0de3d46e7a71a6b","logical_entry_identity":"5e3316b3fc19bec0f7bfb490b8c86dbbe408f7a92812d7ab885ab40a4e81e859","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"died a well-deserved death by exsanguination","source_tag":"_t","target":"因失血过多而死，罪有应得"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cd89fc9444c4f4adb8ea8715f934a45984792e584925476949776ec758aa83f1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ef0bf37a04b13fa04a224c450228bf96f02fe41747f33a7b447bd7b124507fa1","logical_entry_identity":"6e5566562a5c48b49a6aad453de14f2aa74b15699cd62b9a87297f84252ff6f6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You feel a thrill of terror and your heart begins to pound in your chest. You feel terribly threatened upon entering this area.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你因恐惧而感到不安，你觉得你的心跳开始加速，你感到进入这个区域对你有极大的威胁。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"67e073da4eb3a0d3916849e5f70124d9d3146e25896a1a5c65d3148e7429f159","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ef0c2e5e04757681b16c9e43624f2cbf3ebb73d3120327e025b9de117c878aa5","logical_entry_identity":"23952088323c929850e3849bf9f1585b238beb039f250d9ed9398d9b1b6af471","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Orb of Undeath (Orb of Command)","source_tag":"entity name","target":"指令水晶球（亡灵）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"70de00fe7192d2978878938bbcc35f93581a607288a2bbb0c46ca7