ld be sufficient to forge powerful artifacts!\nGo to the lake and then summon me with this scroll. I will retire to study the tome, awaiting your summon.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*他快速浏览了那本手册，露出了惊讶的表情。*#WHITE# 这真是神奇的发现！太神奇了！\n有了这些知识我就能制造更强大的项链了。不过这需要一个特殊的地方来完成制作过程。\n传言在南部山脉之中有个地方充满能量。有个古老的传说，当冬月与太阳距离太接近的时候它的一部分从空中掉落了下来并融入了大地，使那个地方充满能量。\n在坠落的地方形成了一个湖泊，湖水吸收了万年月光的力量，应该足以锻造出强大的神器。\n去找到那个湖泊，然后使用这个卷轴将我召唤过去，从现在开始我要潜心研修你的这本手册，等待你召唤我的那一刻。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"969734ab76382dbadc41b7d18559747a1a0ec21d4e679831b41c53c3e577611d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ef805bf057ab112c3462ac62962818d8f5d0bc31aea2338c8aa73eee0b9863b5","logical_entry_identity":"862ed406bc834dd36b968c0a38718bea472628b49559ef9342a41e030bbf9312","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"generic inc damage nature","source_tag":"entity name","target":"通用 增加自然伤害"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d860a26beca143d597df7ce94330426d9b7712e523e645e921df0a023e2aaae9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ef88e6a80185db3dbd603f80b5fcd33bf1f70360777c5a989fa8bc9ca1c88ec7","logical_entry_identity":"3003a44d737ebf791c548e7f437fa27165c0a494c3e2a2add582ff8516c12e9d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The odds have tilted.","source_tag":"_t","target":"几率发生了倾斜。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5f2f776f90b885a376c4ec7fe7ea89b21e9ddcee57b23850a3b1d5c8132096c4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ef89ccdc98ecc50d85e61cd67684f20348fac1d29cb850ddec0c1833cad25662","logical_entry_identity":"97d1f1ef850885939d5506543e1b6b90e66039d5480ab2942b4e5b2eb3aaaa97","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"fountain","source_tag":"entity name","target":"喷泉"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"90ab4c686aa3bfb70f434aad571dd5339c0922155b02104c9de0c7945db0f795","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ef8f919bf382668c38daaf2ea2dbe08c23131afe78d72e09386a7d0f43ed3ab3","logical_entry_identity":"90cc2313dc6f43bbb8128d3b8dfbcd2008d697ee48509faa5044b68094537375","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This deformed beast might have been a wolf before, but now it is just... terrible.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这只畸形的巨兽之前或许是头狼，不过现在……它很可怕。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4039e7ed8c37fda949fa103c07354778cdf6b1aee022785c695745b62d0f2d62","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ef9189014fb1a40a2feb4a2965c2063aa1d415ffab58f860428ddfcda9880996","logical_entry_identity":"f7a026abd6ad579d2ebd8a879ad8d66f0bcad23cf37edf37c1b724ec35f84305","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*The two Sorcerers lie dead before you.*#WHITE#\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*Their bodies vanish in a small cloud of mist, quickly fading away.*#WHITE#\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*You feel the Way reaching out to you, the whole yeek race speaks to you.*#WHITE#\nYou have done something incredible %s! You also have created a unique opportunity for the yeek race!\nThe energies of those farportals are incredible, using them we could make the Way radiate all over Eyal, forcing it down on the other races, bringing them the same peace and happiness we feel in the Way.\nYou must go through the farportal and willingly sacrifice yourself inside. Your mind will embed itself into the farportal network, spreading the Way far and wide!\nEven though you will die you will bring the world, and the yeeks, ultimate peace.\nThe Way will never forget you. Now go and make history!\n","source_tag":"tformat","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*两个魔法师死在你面前。*#WHITE#\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*他们的尸体化成了一缕青烟，很快消失了。*#WHITE#\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*你感觉到维网和你发生了联系，整个夺心魔族在和你对话。*#WHITE#\n你完成了令人难以置信的使命，%s！你也为夺心魔族创造了千载难逢的机会！\n这些远行传送门蕴含着难以想象的能量。我们可以利用它们让维网照遍整个埃亚尔，将维网强加给其他种族，使他们也获得我们在维网中感受到的和平与幸福。\n你必须穿过远行传送门，自愿在其中牺牲。你的心智将融入远行传送门网络，让维网传播到四面八方！\n即使你将死去，也会为整个世界和夺心魔带来最终的和平。\n维网永远不会忘记你，现在，去创造历史吧！\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cb2b762832f6920807d9cbeb8293fb2c2a1e815980d31c7415262cb134079a64","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ef93aa92ccee297d882f64c39f1a50b83749e5f1ab8ade421b2565b8f21fb2a1","logical_entry_identity":"2277934d200d4c161422a9732022c6ea2e2bc74eacc9e410c0154e1654837493","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"TAKE THIS LIST OF INGREDIENTS, AND HURRY THE HELL UP.","source_tag":"_t","target":"拿好配料清单，动作快点。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"942e2376172b8bcb2a3ad191ac7357d8f0d6e380bd05ddb0421ebb2e90feb898","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ef9f97a2e35279283eb9a65b619c956c309c9fdce53a4f3b656da98956a54c4d","logical_entry_identity":"9ba846a4c1f48ac1576f54699576a54aedf2b16f2c429cf231bfbe66af421008","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Fire and guide an arrow to its target with precise telekinetic nudges. Does normal damage, but accuracy and crit chance are increased by %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"射出一支导引箭精确的飞向敌人。造成普通伤害，但是命中和暴击率提高 %d。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e84942d88e4d9dd63c22b9f98ecf4823bcc23c1e8a51f1256028aca316f5be65","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efada989cc7a393b3c6369a390cafcb79dafbc0fd666055207892833606d3577","logical_entry_identity":"6c1d64323f487d9c05e00edbad202d3f93e44e155fae4e584f2b3fa37fa2f47b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" of mindcraft","source_tag":"entity name","target":"心灵锻造之"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1765e52eaf478b0871b8b60a886e76b041d6c2fa49015c3fddfd7bb80f96e595","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efae1bf28a7d0c7d2abeb6656503a5e07b303589b0ea9dc7b9b4f3602173b3da","logical_entry_identity":"ea738c3145017c92dae3aaf99fd7d782f953ae5b32feb584ed401b469866f801","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have learned to hit the right spot, increasing your armor penetration by %d when dual wielding.\n\t\tThe Armour penetration bonus will increase with your Dexterity.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你已经学会打击弱点位置，双持时增加你 %d 点护甲穿透。\n\t\t护甲穿透受敏捷值加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dd525e3eb76e29fff3aa02255dc2d2aab5d0cfd6a08abc078c06c3007d549437","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efae3d0b98ca29bc095c1d130542e9c954e5d401256161027bb7920d43223297","logical_entry_identity":"284ad26cce975acabf7c8a4d88895ce95ef22b26e6df34d944f82a7f9ca43fbd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Goedalath Rock","source_tag":"entity name","target":"高达勒斯之石"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"81ba91255657617b87a09331b77f5998171f1764d368a12c7f6ad0ab215ac352","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efaf9b0f43989b1d9b1e0ddbcf3faa070ee1df3d02c5b2ed229cafab5ae8d809","logical_entry_identity":"30500e4b76d8075442f9c8bda9f41794332efb85bd727297447b7e0dbb9c8227","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"sacrificing %s to stop the mad sun's plans","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%s牺牲自己，以阻止疯狂太阳的计划"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"da8dd668b7575b3fa0558d6713a44ff3cec2bfc08f06abcc49943602469569f0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efb1df7db5820f9d944c689fe535dff843b2e4bec37473d6acb066bb4c889f84","logical_entry_identity":"051672f65a64aebc304fee09edf772f60622f47b8dcb1837427767ceba570989","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The Spellblaze Chronicles(4): Before the Dawn","source_tag":"_t","target":"魔法大爆炸纪事(4)：黎明将至"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"81b51aba877862e20b673295b16ed4c5e4457390f4d8df483747f175844f5513","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efb3685bedeb150eb20e650ccd2ef850b7f24739cbfc428cf6b63650e406d2c4","logical_entry_identity":"0067fee828865bf8f743502a3d55575ac237a8e06b38fd9b046eabb88a9ab32d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Turn your body into pure flame, increasing your fire resistance by %d%%, burning any creatures striking you in melee for %0.2f fire damage, and randomly launching up to %d slow-moving fire bolt(s) per turn at targets in sight, each dealing %0.2f fire damage.\n\t\tThe projectiles safely go through your friends without harming them.\n\t\tThe damage and resistance will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"将身体化为纯粹的火焰，使你的火焰抗性提高 %d%%；任何以近战攻击你的生物都会受到 %0.2f 点火焰伤害；每回合还会随机向视野内的目标发射最多 %d 枚缓慢移动的火焰弹，每枚造成 %0.2f 点火焰伤害。\n\t\t这些弹体会安全地穿过友方生物，不会对其造成伤害。\n\t\t伤害和抗性随你的法术强度提高。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2db089b429f5dbb81efd20812575d5834102c8df1993c0be06dac2f318f8df34","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efc423264011f26dd88b00e59ef5c26c835a256f2962bd256cba7bd6a744b0da","logical_entry_identity":"14cf1342a108ec83b8550aaf8bba451bae3c04537b6b300eeb2edf2ce12bc8e9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Those who partake in the profane sorcery can oft be marked by their appearance, their mannerisms, their personal keeping and their effect on the environment around them. Keep close watch on all you meet, for they are deceptive creatures that can take on many guises. Even women, children and cripples may be clever disguises of demon-communers and necromancers.\n\nIn their appearance you should be wary of the following:\n* Particular grossness in complexion\n* Unnatural or \"elven\" beauty\n* Extreme thinness, with prominent bones\n* Pointed or sharp-tipped ears - beware indeed of those with long hair or hats covering their ears\n* Hunched backs and distorting limps\n* Peculiar eye colour\n\nIn their behaviour you should be wary of the following:\n* Tiredness during daylight hours and heavy activity at night\n* Social aversion and fear of crowded places\n* A questioning and probing attitude, in particular if challenging the precepts and set morals of society\n* Quick-wittedness, especially where used for guile\n* Furtiveness or a secretive attitude\n\nIn their effect on their environment you should be wary of the following:\n* Causing grass to wilt and flowers to close as they pass\n* Animals are alarmed by their presence, particularly dogs\n* Crops wilt and cows' milk turns sour\n* Arguments are stirred within their presence\n* Women's moontide flow becomes more effluent\n* Apparitions and unexplained events occur in their surroundings\n\nNote that a spellweaver will doubtless deny any accusation against them, and will show great emotion when evidence is laid before them. But one should not delay in bringing swift judgement, lest they try to cast a hex or escape by arcane means.","source_tag":"_t","target":"参与亵渎巫术的人，往往可从其外貌、举止、个人起居以及对周围环境的影响识别出来。密切监视你遇到的每个人，因为这些诡诈生物能够披上许多伪装。即便是妇女、儿童和残废，也可能只是与恶魔沟通者和死灵法师的巧妙伪装。\n\n观察其外貌时，应警惕以下特征：\n* 面容格外粗陋\n* 不自然或“精灵般”的美貌\n* 极端消瘦，骨骼突出\n* 耳朵尖锐或耳尖锋利——尤其要提防用长发或帽子遮住耳朵的人\n* 驼背，以及扭曲的跛行步态\n* 异常的眼睛颜色\n\n观察其行为时，应警惕以下特征：\n* 白天疲惫，夜间活动频繁\n* 厌恶社交并畏惧拥挤场所\n* 喜爱质疑和刨根问底，尤其是挑战社会准则与既定道德\n* 头脑机敏，特别是把聪明才智用于诡计时\n* 行踪鬼祟或态度隐秘\n\n观察其对环境的影响时，应警惕以下征象：\n* 所过之处青草枯萎、花朵闭合\n* 动物会因其出现而惊慌，尤其是狗\n* 庄稼枯萎，牛奶变酸\n* 其在场时，人们会被挑动起来争吵\n* 妇女的月潮流量增多\n* 其周围出现幽灵和无法解释的事件\n\n须知，织法者无疑会否认对他们的一切指控；当证据摆到面前时，他们还会表现得极为激动。但裁决不可拖延，必须迅速执行，以免他们施放邪术或借奥术手段逃脱。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"060b667a44fac4ce9a8bfea80af54494714f33dde9a9211583b534a2aa1d03aa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efc4ac1ee55772e3420d04221a386a19d4c9019fd0e0b71c8f2c02ffbbc4c177","logical_entry_identity":"ab97d784c53e98e6b0e9dd595148b6e8f4391300b739d3ed5a937d36e7091200","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"It's said that some rare powers can save your soul from the edge of death.","source_tag":"init.lua load_tips","target":"传说有些罕见的力量可以在死亡边缘拯救你的灵魂。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6b0a4a87ff3bae34f7def9e8b6d55a4f4db5235a0ebe576ea683a0cd843d6e47","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efc643a4cc6dc4b10d31d29d1d9da440faa0a4479616f5a140ac4b191331678e","logical_entry_identity":"ffedb169c78d1c90126b7cde92b2a019823e0a109af04a5697e5fddad88d43f4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You call upon the earth to create a blinding, corrosive cloud in an area of radius %d for %d turns.\n\t\tEach turn, this cloud deals %0.1f acid damage to each foe with a 25%% chance to blind and a %d%% chance of burning away one magical sustain or beneficial magical effect.\n\t\tThe damage increases with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你召唤酸云覆盖半径 %d 的地面，持续 %d 回合。酸云具有腐蚀性，能致盲敌人。\n\t\t每回合，酸云对每个敌人造成 %0.1f 点酸性伤害，25%% 几率致盲，同时有 %d%% 几率除去一个有益的魔法效果或魔法持续技能。\n\t\t伤害受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d83ebfd890569c30cd9ad1a1d998ef20c7a097c6a436cb66cffb9df4d4591e0f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efcb667b030d0d8a0d171a1350c52cb782d97e2f64e9dd914d20635b75a354f0","logical_entry_identity":"5a61970fdf1693ea88e8f61d96985ef744b0754ae57cc4c96f7a8f0cc58a983a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You need more room to swing your hook effectively.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你需要更多空间来使用钩爪。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2347d22e5efd809be8fce518f5cb67a6a4c16031c40eba4bd7602668e13bea8c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efcbdbd21a98feb832e98e28be839b26d1c0c73afa6ab12a129639a74cf36830","logical_entry_identity":"f1728f38a635ce341352dc3a70ec258d3d1b17eec4a0197813af5ce115afa4f6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Overpowered!","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"过于强大！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1f2514472633ed04ac312c9bafecab9f5a2163bb7bd0452cbbfc8b3a0e49eccf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efd01cf77c42076ad9a583a37ad94ab70760f5c17c2fad5b51cd66f23b8e33ae","logical_entry_identity":"491cbf21a2757cfa55aed67d95b57658f5135d2d40256768ce93d7a022a41342","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"There is an inscription here:\n#{italic}#...Unleash dark thoughts.\nUpon this blighted land!#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"这里有一段铭文：\n#{italic}#……释放黑暗意念，\n笼罩这片枯萎之地！#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e7e0f96a393016c9c3ee63b719c8b3ed0dc3b31838af3441d918750cc0786d19","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efd24b689fd0e40742da49559ce28652c004821e0103205b7da96850662e208b","logical_entry_identity":"a46612e17a51fd87662cb39f8d445b8c89836457e68f49b7c4656c2cfe669e97","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sided with the assassin lord.","source_tag":"_t","target":"与刺客领主同流合污。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"933413b480b444c2f6209ca934c61b8c30bbed3dc10e0442fb475f7d19c470ee","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"efd8f598c9de87c37808ffbe2299acf28baa3ad904d1e46983e903c963ca2e0f","logical_entry_ident